A||N||11||CFOG||Announcement.......!!||||1||
Z||000000||CFOG||09-22-2001||01:52 AM||||Classic Fiero Owners Group International (CFOG-I) is a global organization committed to inform and enlighten Fiero owners worldwide. We have put together an organization, which will truly be a "members" club -- not only accountable to, but accessible to its members. With member benefits such as a toll-free technical "hotline", group automobile insurance coverage, and additional member and club incentives, Classic Fiero Owners Group International is available for clubs and individuals alike........<P>We recognize the fact that organizations of this magnitude have been attempted before and we have taken a good look at the success and failures of the groups preceding this one. We believe that we have put policies and procedures in place to assure our success and are employing people highly knowledgeable of the Fiero and, any and all of them are there for your assistance. This is not an attempt at replacing any other organization but rather to offer the Fiero owners and clubs and alternative.........<P>We also recognize the fact that there are individuals who have the desire to start clubs in their area and we are there with assistance for them to accomplish that task, from a "club starter package" containing how to start a club to a web site design package for clubs, Classic Fiero Owners Group International is there for the member........we are also in the process of producing a "club introduction package" for individuals who are already members of a club to present to their clubs in the event they wish to join in this organization.<P>We invite you to take a look at the club web site at  <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog-i.org</A>  and join with us as we grow in this new and exciting venture..........Regional Director and Deputy Director positions may be available in your area. If interested, call Classic Fiero Owners Group International, toll free, at 866-FIERO GT (343-7648).<P>Terry Owens<BR>Chairman<BR>Classic Fiero Owners Group International||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever3000||09-25-2001||12:58 AM||||Tell us what you need.  Chances are it's already under discussion.  If not, it will be.  <P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I><BR>Vice President, <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>Classic Fiero Owners Group International</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||2M4 Dale||09-27-2001||12:50 AM||||This is gonna be GREAT !!! guys and gals !!!<P>Dale Starcher<BR>Central Regional Director CFOG-I <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cfog-i.org/index.html</A> <P>||||reg||14
Z||000003||Cheever3000||09-29-2001||11:32 PM||||I'm hearing good things that there is a LOT of interest all over for this international club, i.e. it's <I>happening</I>!  Keep checking the website, and talk it up with your local club.  More importantly, it's here for YOU, so <I>get involved</I> and you'll find it very responsive to what you need.||||reg||1
