Z||000009||tgowens||10-24-2001||12:07 AM||||I have personally checked all of the information requests for both CFOG (the local club) and CFOG-International and do not see a message from you. I have also reviewed the email logs of the others who recieve the information requessts and cannot locate one there either.<P>We have several who recieve these requests to faciliate answers to them. Please go to the information page and send your request again and I will personally see that it is answered -- here is the link --  <A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org/information.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cfog-i.org/information.html</A> <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.whgraphics.com" TARGET=_blank>West Highland Graphics & Design</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>Classic Fiero Owners Group International</A>||||reg||1
